+ * Throws unless a row another write points at belongs to `orgId`. References
+ * (a label, a parent issue, a parent comment) are looked up by id alone so
+ * that "in another workspace" can be told apart from "does not exist"; this
+ * is the check that turns the former into a scope violation.
